原 Reader 用例本地一次通过，独立冷恢复对照两例通过，都没有复现 CI 故障。\n- 新诊断正常路径一次通过；三项受控 helper 边界通过。人为阻断合成请求时，原 5 秒断言实际失败并生成三类诊断，仅证明观察路径可留证。\n- 四处改动独立静态审查无新增阻断。GitHub 真实失败产物上传及此轮提交 CI 待运行，不以本地结果代替。\n\n依赖未合并 PR #49；本 PR 保持 draft/open，M5.3 实施暂停。保留原失败、早期附件丢失事实及所有测试边界。独立 DeepSeek 最小接口调用成功与平台 Tutor/Agent 实现分开记录；无凭据、个人内容或付费调用加入 CI。\n\nRefs #27\n\n诊断发布 HEAD：`73d65af4bae237e72fb9a0a6294028cfbad62823`；后续 CI 按此确切提交单独回读。\n","created_at":"2026-09-15T10:23:58Z","updated_at":"2026-09-15T11:10:50Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"757ccd2c67ee5fad9fd44bb29697e05fd9b70d04","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":true,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kl3574/Learning_Workbench/pulls/50/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kl3574/Learning_Workbench/pulls/50/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kl3574/Learning_Workbench/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kl3574/Learning_Workbench/issues/50/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kl3574/Learning_Workbench/statuses/73d65af4bae237e72fb9a0a6294028cfbad62823","head":{"label":"kl3574:feat/M5.2-local-retrieval","ref":"feat/M5.2-local-retrieval","sha":"73d65af4bae237e72fb9a0a6294028cfbad62823","user":{"login":"kl3574","id":31810429,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxODEwNDI5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31810429?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kl3574","html_url":"https://github.com/kl3574","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kl3574/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kl3574/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kl3574/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kl3574/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kl3574/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kl3574/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kl35